<Base title="About">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>The 380 is a going-out guide for both ends of the Corridor</h1>
  <p class="lede">Iowa City, Coralville, North Liberty, Cedar Rapids and Marion, treated as one place to go out, because for most of us they are.</p>
  <p>The model is the old Chicago Metromix: a database of every bar and restaurant, an event calendar, picks with a point of view, and photos from last night. No paywall. No news. No press releases.</p>
  <h2 id="advertise">Advertise</h2>
  <p>Featured listings in Drink and Eat, sponsor slots in the Thursday email, and presenting sponsorships for every Hawkeye home Saturday. Email ads@380tonight.com.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Every listing started from a public source and is marked until we've walked in. If your hours, happy hour, or address is wrong, email hello@380tonight.com and it's fixed the same day.</p>
</Base>
